{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202653H1lhGHNS1793199096.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>英國上調銀行利潤附加稅增加至百分之6。</p><p></p><p>英國政府計劃將銀行利潤附加稅，由現時百分之3提高至百分之6，明年1月起實施，為期15個月。</p><p></p><p>英國財政大臣賀理安表示，期望透過增加銀行業稅收，以紓緩公共財政壓力。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T15:58:14.249162+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T14:50:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T20:38:13.042426+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T15:55:39.732160+00:00","content_hash":"1eb51e887973cc8114d8f23d0520a286a4860a4539b980db2f5d80f30936d4e2","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}